    "updated_at": "2016-11-22T20:37:56Z",
    "body": "This is basically part of https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1221\r\n\r\nSo far I have only changed the spec to require usage of logical properties where the majority of browser engines already did. A bunch of cases are left where only Gecko does, or where nobody uses logical properties (like this issue apparently, and `<hr align>`). I would be happy to change the spec to require more logical properties though if there is impl interest.",
